    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28489" root="عذل" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَذَّالَةٌ</span></b>  A man <i>who blames,</i> or <i>censures,</i> [<i>very</i>]
<i>much</i> or <i>often:</i> the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span> is added to render it [more]
<i>intensive.</i> (O, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Also fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَذَّالٌ</span>, q. v.]
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَذَّالَةُ</span> is an appellation of <i>The</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْت</span>
[i. e. the <i>podex,</i> or the <i>anus</i>]. (O, K.)

